  "about": {
    "lead": {
      "zh": "“时间轴上的印度”把印度历史上的重大事件放在一条可以拖动的时间轴上，按时期着色。<span id=\"aboutSummary\"></span>点开每个事件可以看详细说明和图片。",
      "en": "<i>India Through Time</i> places the major events of Indian history on one timeline you can drag, colored by era. <span id=\"aboutSummary\"></span>open any event for details and pictures."
    },
    "sources": {
      "zh": "事件文字由本站编写，参考了<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">维基百科</a>等资料，以 <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.zh-hans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a> 许可发布；每个事件的详情页列出了参考链接。",
      "en": "Event texts were written for this site with reference to <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikipedia</a> and other sources, and are released under <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>; each event lists its references."
    },
